8,"y":525,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"중인","x":1413,"y":524,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"기","x":1491,"y":523,"width":26,"height":36}]},{"text":"계의 경우에는 무조건 피하게 된다. 단편화를 완화해야 하는 대부분의 현존하는 시스템","words":[{"text":"계의","x":289,"y":582,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"경우에는","x":370,"y":584,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"무조건","x":512,"y":585,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"피하게","x":621,"y":585,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"된다.","x":724,"y":585,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"단편화를","x":803,"y":585,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"완화해야","x":936,"y":585,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"하는","x":1070,"y":586,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"대부분의","x":1146,"y":585,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"현존하는","x":1285,"y":586,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"시스템","x":1426,"y":583,"width":92,"height":37}]},{"text":"들은 온라인 시점인 시스템의 정상 가동 중에 밀집 작업을 처리하지만, 시스템의 성능을","words":[{"text":"들은","x":291,"y":642,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"온라인","x":366,"y":642,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"시점인","x":478,"y":643,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"시스템의","x":586,"y":644,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"정상","x":721,"y":645,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"가동","x":791,"y":645,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"중에","x":860,"y":644,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"밀집","x":934,"y":645,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"작업을","x":1004,"y":645,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"처리하지만,","x":1110,"y":645,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"시스템의","x":1286,"y":645,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"성능을","x":1425,"y":643,"width":96,"height":37}]},{"text":"심각하게 저하하는 요인이 된다.","words":[{"text":"심각하게","x":288,"y":701,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"저하하는","x":433,"y":702,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"요인이","x":571,"y":704,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":676,"y":704,"width":66,"height":36}]},{"text":"연속 할당은 또 다른 문제점이 있다. 파일을 위해서 얼마나 많은 공간을 주어야 할지","words":[{"text":"연속","x":352,"y":762,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"할당은","x":427,"y":762,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"또","x":536,"y":767,"width":32,"height":26},{"text":"다른","x":580,"y":763,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"문제점이","x":652,"y":764,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":787,"y":764,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"파일을","x":864,"y":764,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"위해서","x":966,"y":765,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"얼마나","x":1069,"y":765,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":1170,"y":765,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"공간을","x":1244,"y":765,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"주어야","x":1349,"y":765,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"할지","x":1456,"y":765,"width":60,"height":35}]},{"text":"를 결정하는 것이다. 파일 생성자가(프로그램 또는 사람) 생성될 파일의 크기를 알 수 있","words":[{"text":"를","x":286,"y":822,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"결정하는","x":334,"y":822,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":478,"y":823,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":593,"y":823,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"생성자가(프로그램","x":667,"y":824,"width":250,"height":38},{"text":"또는","x":932,"y":826,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"사람)","x":1003,"y":825,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"생성될","x":1087,"y":825,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"파일의","x":1190,"y":825,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"크기를","x":1295,"y":826,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"알","x":1402,"y":825,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1444,"y":825,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"있","x":1490,"y":825,"width":29,"height":35}]},{"text":"는가? 많은 경우 만들어질 파일의 그기를 예측하는 것은 어렵다.","words":[{"text":"는가?","x":285,"y":882,"width":83,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":382,"y":883,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":462,"y":883,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"만들어질","x":536,"y":882,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"파일의","x":672,"y":883,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"그기를","x":774,"y":884,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"예측하는","x":877,"y":884,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"것은","x":1009,"y":885,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"어렵다.","x":1079,"y":885,"width":97,"height":36}]},{"text":"만약에 너무 작은 공간을 예약했다면 파일이 커질 수 없다. 특히 최적 적합(best-fit)","words":[{"text":"만약에","x":349,"y":943,